== Your File
  setting: The Desktop
  cast: The Uploader
The Uploader: Your file, {program.name}. Closing it for the night.
if program.featured == "excel":
  The Uploader: On file: Randy Barkmore Sr., ninety, five terms as Mayor of Halifax. You came to live forever, and to run for Mayor once more.
else if program.featured == "openoffice":
  The Uploader: On file: Dana Anderson, formerly of the FBI. You came to have every record of the hack destroyed.
else if program.featured == "draftkings":
  The Uploader: On file: the artist formerly known as Crab Fisherwoman. You came to win your casinos back.
else if program.featured == "bugdom":
  The Uploader: On file: Bea Nunes, of the crickets. You came for a hundred hours for every minute, to build Bugdom Reloaded again.
else if program.featured == "jeeves":
  The Uploader: On file: Virgil Jeeves, children's librarian. You came for the Map Librarian job, and to be asked again.
else if program.featured == "runescape":
